<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov trade gap $104mln vs Oct $164mln - c.bnk.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov trade gap $104mln vs Oct $164mln - c.bnk.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's trade deficit was $104 million in November, down from $164 million in October, the National Bank of Hungary said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    ($ million)    Nov 96   Oct 96   Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p>    Exports	  1,286    1,409     12,791	 11,659</p>
<p>    Imports	  1,389    1,574     14,988	 13,852</p>
<p>    Trade balance   -104     -164     -2,196	 -2,193</p>
<p>NOTE - The central bank's figures are based on cash flow.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
